  "description": "Optional local explanation-coverage comparison on unchanged PSR controls. NoBrute and Brute are logical comparison labels relative to stipulated explains, not a substantive philosophical dilemma or adequate-explanation verdict. Causal structure is independent; the external-cause dimension quantifies over all model worlds. No root premise is assumed true. The existing population/WF/universal-external-causation contradiction is exposed through an operational adapter; it uses no explanation premise.",
